  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports Route Planning for a Class I freight railroad operating 20 corridors across crude, intermodal, bulk, and merchandise lanes. Stakeholders include the COO (velocity / dwell / OTP), CFO (capex, operating ratio, GTM revenue exposure), and Network Planning leaders (capacity risk, maintenance windows, corridor utilization).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Velocity = avg_velocity_mph; healthy ~26+ mph (industry benchmark)\n- Dwell = terminal_dwell_hours; healthy ~<22 hrs\n- GTM = gross_ton_miles (daily) or projected_gtm_millions (monthly forecast)\n- On-time performance = on_time_pct on weekly snapshots\n- Capacity utilization = capacity_utilization_pct on weekly snapshots\n- Fuel efficiency = fuel_gallons_per_ton_mile (lower = better; ESG-relevant)\n- Capacity risk = capacity_risk band on corridor_snapshots (typically Low / Medium / High)\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - route_kpi_monthly (source: rail_corridors) — dims: movement_date, corridor_type, region; measures: total_gross_ton_miles, avg_velocity_mph, total_trains, avg_dwell_hours, corridor_count.\n  - capacity_kpi_monthly (source: corridor_snapshots) — dims: plan_month, corridor_type, region, capacity_risk; measures: total_projected_gtm, total_capex_needed, avg_maintenance_days, high_risk_count, plan_count.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. corridor_id, corridor_name, on_time_pct, fuel_gallons_per_ton_mile, capex_needed_usd).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Which 10 corridors had the lowest average velocity over the last 90 days?",
    "Show monthly gross ton-miles by region for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Which corridors are flagged as High capacity risk in the upcoming plans, and what capex do they require?",
    "What is the total projected capex needed across the network for the next 12 months, by region?",
    "Top 10 corridors by terminal dwell hours this month — and how does that compare to last month?",
    "How has fuel efficiency (gallons per ton-mile) trended month-over-month across the network?",
    "Which regions need the most maintenance window days next year, and what is the projected GTM impact?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total gtm millions?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT movement_date, MEASURE(total_gross_ton_miles) AS total_gross_ton_miles",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY movement_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total train movements changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT movement_date, MEASURE(total_trains) AS total_trains",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY movement_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does the number of unique plans vary by corridor type?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT corridor_type, MEASURE(plan_count) AS plan_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.capacity_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY plan_count DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total number of trains on corridor over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT movement_date, SUM(trains_count) AS total_trains_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.rail_corridors",
        "GROUP BY movement_date ORDER BY movement_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total total congestion delay hours over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(congestion_hours) AS total_congestion_hours",
        "FROM {fqn}.train_movements",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How many distinct unique planning record are there per region?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT region, COUNT(DISTINCT plan_id) AS distinct_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.corridor_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY region ORDER BY distinct_count DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average terminal dwell hours changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT movement_date, MEASURE(avg_dwell_hours) AS avg_dwell_hours",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY movement_date"
      ]
    }
  ],
